        <mxCell id="c75" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" value="&lt;b&gt;CloudFormation stacks — deploy order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;dev-webstore-vpc&lt;/b&gt; (shared) — VPC, IGW, 2 public + 2 private subnets, NAT GW, route tables, sg-alb, sg-ecs&lt;br&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;dev-webstore-ecs-infra&lt;/b&gt; (shared) — ECS cluster, ALB, Listener :80 (default 404)&lt;br&gt;3. per service (&lt;font color=&#39;#147EBA&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;catalog&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color=&#39;#3F8624&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;cart&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;):  a. &lt;b&gt;dev-webstore-&amp;lt;svc&amp;gt;-iam&lt;/b&gt; (task execution + task roles) → b. &lt;b&gt;-codebuild&lt;/b&gt; (ECR, CodeBuild project/role, log group) → c. &lt;b&gt;-service&lt;/b&gt; (ECS service, target group, listener rule) → d. &lt;b&gt;-pipeline&lt;/b&gt; (EventBridge rule, Lambda + role + log group)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="1700" x="305" y="1195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
